# Schema: Polkadot SDK PRDoc Schema (prdoc) v1.0.0
# See doc at https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paritytech/polkadot-sdk/master/prdoc/schema_user.json

title: Migration to upgrade stored XCM data to the latest version

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds `polkadot_runtime_common::xcm_migration::MigrateXcmToLatest`, a multi-block migration
      that upgrades the versioned XCM data stored by pallets to the latest XCM version. It covers
      `pallet_asset_rate::ConversionRateToNative`, `pallet_treasury::Spends` and
      `pallet_multi_asset_bounties::Bounties`.

      The `try-runtime` checks of `pallet_xcm::migration::MigrateToLatestXcmVersion` now also
      cover `AuthorizedAliases`.

      The Westend, Rococo, Asset Hub Westend and Collectives Westend runtimes run the migration.
      Collectives Westend gains `pallet-migrations`.

crates:
  - name: polkadot-runtime-common
    bump: minor
  - name: pallet-xcm
    bump: patch
  - name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
    bump: patch
  - name: collectives-westend-runtime
    bump: major
  - name: westend-runtime
    bump: patch
  - name: rococo-runtime
    bump: patch
